sequenceDiagram
  participant BIO as Cliente bioquimico
  participant API as Validation API
  participant RES as Results API
  participant DB as Validation DB
  BIO->>API: POST /api/v1/lab-results/{id}/validation
  API->>RES: GET resultado + version
  RES-->>API: valor/version/tenant
  API->>API: permiso y transicion de estado
  API->>DB: guardar decision y auditoria
  DB-->>API: decision persistida
  API-->>BIO: 201 decision + correlation_id
